  - key: PAYTABLE_DESCRIPTION_4
    value: 'Spin the Wheel and build your own Free Games.

      You can win the followings:

      - Coin Prizes

      - Jackpots

      - Double up Coin Prizes on Rapid Win Symbols

      - Remove Mini Jackpot on Rapid Win Symbols

      - Add one more row

      - Extra Free Spins

      - Rapid Win Symbols in Super Stacks

      You can spin until winning Free Games wedge and non-Free Games wedges won are
      replaced with Free Games each spin.

      More Rapid Win Symbols will be added to reels during Free Games regardless of
      the results from the Wheel.'
  - key: PAYTABLE_TITLE_5
    value: ACTIVE REELS FEATURE
  - key: PAYTABLE_DESCRIPTION_5
    value: 'Rapid Win Symbols only on active reels awards prizes on them.

      Increase your denomination and activate more reels to enjoy more of Rapid Win
      Symbols!

'
